#N canvas 20 20 2900 1700 12;
#X declare -path ../../Cut\ It;
#X text 20 20 GENERATED by state-assert-drive-gen.py -- DO NOT HAND-EDIT. Regenerated by state-assert.sh on every run \, so an edit here is lost rather than wrong \, which is the safer of the two., f 70;
#X obj 20 140 loadbang;
#X obj 20 1500 u_state /tmp/cut-it-state-gate;
#X text 1500 140 THE HONEST CONTRIBUTOR answers the save broadcast in the same call stack \, which is what the contract requires and what every real one must do., f 70;
#X obj 1500 320 r state;
#X obj 1500 380 route save restore;
#X msg 1500 450 put manual take-1 kick 36 snare 38;
#X obj 1500 500 s state;
#X obj 1900 450 print RESTORE;
#X text 2250 140 THE DISHONEST ONE answers 5 ms late. It MUST NOT reach the file. If this key ever appears \, the synchronous contract has silently stopped holding and every contributor written against it is at risk., f 70;
#X obj 2250 380 del 5;
#X msg 2250 450 put manual late-key 999;
#X obj 2250 500 s state;
#X obj 20 260 del 100;
#X msg 20 320 put auto mode compose mode-1;
#X obj 20 380 s state;
#X obj 480 260 del 150;
#X msg 480 320 put auto tempo 128;
#X obj 480 380 s state;
#X obj 940 260 del 200;
#X msg 940 320 put auto mode perform mode-4;
#X obj 940 380 s state;
#X text 20 700 THE 3600 ms IS LOAD-BEARING AND MUST NOT BE SHORTENED. The bug this gate exists to catch armed the flush from a loadbang at 3000 ms while u_init restores at ~3500 ms -- so the write landed BEFORE the read. Bang the restore any earlier than 3000 here and that ordering never happens \, the gate passes a broken patch \, and it did exactly that once. THE RESTORE BANG ALSO ARMS THE AUTO FLUSH \, which is deliberate rather than incidental: u_state must never write a file it has not yet read \, or a boot would overwrite the previous session with its own defaults. Found on the Mac before it ever reached hardware., f 70;
#X obj 20 880 del 3600;
#X msg 20 940 bang;
#X text 1500 700 saveState IS mother.pd's RESERVED NAME and nothing in Cut It may send it. A gate driver is not deployed \, so it is the one place that may., f 70;
#X obj 1500 880 del 4200;
#X msg 1500 940 bang;
#X obj 1500 1000 s saveState;
#X obj 2250 880 del 5400;
#X msg 2250 940 \; pd quit;
